# Scenario 'mail_inbox': メールボックス with the four mails received by 'mail_receive'. Reads mail 1 (sender page, body), registers its
# sender in the address book (SELECT on the sender page -> "セーブするばしょを えらんでください" -> A), reads the ASCII mail 2, reads the 40-line
# mail 4 (character-limit dialog "もじすうのオーバー..."), replies to mail 1 (address/title/body keyboards, saved in the outbox), deletes
# mail 2 with the third icon of the action bar (first "いいえ", then "はい"). List navigation: A on a row opens the icon bar
# (read / reply / delete), A on the first icon reads. Starts from the state left by 'mail_receive'; leaves an address-book entry and a
# saved reply. Screen names = my reading of the screenshots.
wait 400
waitstable 60 max 600
gap 30
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A                        # title -> top menu (the first A is swallowed by the logo)
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A                        # メール
waitstable 60 max 600
tap DOWN x2
wait 30
tap A                        # メールボックス
waitstable 60 max 600
shot list
# --- mail 1: sender page, save the sender to the address book, body
tap A
wait 60
tap A                        # icon bar: first icon = read
waitstable 60 max 600
shot m1_sender
tap SELECT
waitstable 60 max 600
shot m1_save_place
tap A                        # choose the first free slot
waitstable 60 max 600
shot m1_saved_1
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot m1_saved_2
tap B
waitstable 60 max 600
shot m1_saved_3
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot m1_body
tap A                        # back to the list
waitstable 60 max 600
shot m1_list
# --- mail 2 (ASCII)
tap DOWN
wait 30
tap A
wait 60
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot m2_sender
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot m2_body
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot m2_list
# --- mail 3 (multipart, attachment) and mail 4 (40 lines)
tap DOWN
wait 30
tap A
wait 60
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot m3_sender
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot m3_list
tap DOWN
wait 30
tap A
wait 60
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot m4_limit_dialog
tap A                        # OK
waitstable 60 max 600
shot m4_sender
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot m4_body
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot m4_list
# --- delete mail 2 with the third icon: first "いいえ" (default), then "はい"
tap UP x2
wait 30
tap A
wait 60
tap RIGHT x2
wait 40
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot del_confirm
tap A                        # "いいえ" is the default
waitstable 60 max 600
shot del_cancelled
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap LEFT
wait 40
shot del_yes
tap A                        # "はい"
waitstable 60 max 600
shot del_done
# --- reply to mail 1 (second icon)
tap UP
wait 30
tap A
wait 60
tap RIGHT
wait 30
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot reply_address
tap START
wait 40
tap A                        # OK
waitstable 60 max 600
shot reply_title
tap A x3
tap START
wait 40
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot reply_body_intro
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A x4
tap START
wait 40
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot reply_save_menu
tap A                        # save
waitstable 60 max 600
shot reply_save_confirm
tap A                        # はい
waitstable 60 max 900
shot reply_saved
# --- back in the mailbox
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot list_again
tap B
waitstable 60 max 600
shot mail_menu
